@focus id=ACTIVE-001 c=H :: M3.6 Rust IR folds large MOS arrays into near-square row banks and renders placement-independent preview; next=3.6.2 topology-aware complementary-network ordering and hierarchical floorplanning.
@handoff id=HANDOFF-001 c=H :: state=M3.6 preview uses aspect-ratio-scored folded PMOS/NMOS banks rather than one unbounded strip; schematic zoom=2..4096,F/Home fit,Shift-arrow fast pan; 3D zoom range widened+top fit retained; nested M3.7 hierarchy remains active; next=topology-aware ordering+hierarchical floorplanning; val=cargo-test:52,npm-build:pass,tauri-build:pass
@fact id=PRODUCT-001 c=H :: OpenChippy=education-first desktop VLSI studio; Rust owns authoritative models/services; React/Three.js own interaction and visualization.
@constraint id=CONSTRAINT-001 c=H :: preserve user changes; source of truth=code; avoid later-milestone expansion without user scope.
@dec id=ARCH-OWNERSHIP-001 c=H :: serializable project/history/simulation/DRC remain UI-independent Rust; Tauri commands are thin adapters; view state is ephemeral frontend state.
@dec id=PROJECT-LIFECYCLE-001 c=H :: New/Open reset history boundary; Rust workspace owns path,saved snapshot,dirty,undo,redo; circuit rename is persisted+undoable.
@dec id=SCHEMATIC-001 c=H :: CMOS transistors primary; wires persist terminal refs plus optional free endpoint+ordered waypoints; junction=node; output=in; net_label=node.
@dec id=NAV-001 c=H :: schematic wheel/trackpad pans; pinch or modifier-wheel zooms; empty drag/arrows pan; Shift-click multi-select; 3D uses MapControls.
@dec id=DRC-001 c=H :: Rust graph DRC has stable codes; equal-name labels join nets; dangling wire is warning; checks floating,shorted rails,duplicates,disconnected,missing power.
@dec id=LAYOUT-001 c=H :: 3D targets Magic/PDK-style inferred cell layout in abstract technology units; schematic junctions are not physical vias.
@dec id=ROUTER-001 c=H :: Rust preview reserves a size-aware central signal channel; each net has unique Y track; top available metal carries horizontal trunks; process permitting,power/PMOS/NMOS long drops use distinct lower directional layers; transitions add intermediate landing metals+adjacent vias; tracks do not traverse device banks/rails; max-layer bound and NAND cross-net overlap tests enforced.
@dec id=ROUTER-PITCH-001 c=H :: channel track pitch=landing 0.28+clearance 0.04=0.32; via=0.24; pin landing height=0.28; transistor X/Y pitch unchanged; regression requires compact pitch and same-layer isolation.
@dec id=CAMERA-001 c=H :: orthographic top view fits post-generation physical bounds; normalized frustum+zoom keeps center stable; Top view resets.
@dec id=SIM-MODEL-001 c=H :: NMOS conducts iff gate HIGH; PMOS iff gate LOW; outputs={HIGH,LOW,FLOATING,CONTENDED,UNKNOWN}; unknown gates conservatively propagate uncertainty without degrading driven rails.
@dec id=SIM-SETTLE-001 c=H :: switch_state treats provisional FLOATING gate as open so upstream combinational hierarchy can settle without UNKNOWN poisoning of rail-connected groups; explicit UNKNOWN/CONTENDED gates remain SwitchState::Unknown and propagate uncertainty.
@dec id=SIM-API-001 c=H :: backend returns net/output/transistor/wire states; frontend never reimplements solver; palette HIGH=green LOW=blue FLOATING=gray CONTENDED=red UNKNOWN=amber.
@dec id=TRUTH-001 c=H :: truth tables enumerate inputs in component order via production solver, preserve five states+convergence, cap at 8 inputs, and rows can drive live visualization.
@dec id=WAVE-001 c=H :: waveform time unit=integer ns; CLK/CLOCK inputs toggle at half-period; others form binary sequence at change interval; sample only event boundaries.
@dec id=WAVE-BOUNDS-001 c=H :: duration<=1,000,000ns; transitions<=10,000; duration affects time mapping not SVG size; lanes fixed at 52px.
@dec id=M3-PLAN-001 c=H :: M3 slices isolate technology schema,file I/O,device geometry,threshold/resistance behavior,then capacitance/delay; every slice preserves prior truth tables or adds monotonicity tests.
@dec id=M3-TECHFILE-001 c=H :: technology YAML format=1 uses technology header plus nmos/pmos blocks; max_metal_layers is required in YAML,min=2,EDU=5; older embedded JSON defaults=5; concise vt/ron/reference aliases accepted; unknown/missing/nonphysical fields rejected; validated snapshot embedded in Project.
@dec id=M3-GEOMETRY-001 c=H :: Component has optional deviceGeometry W/L; new MOS use active-tech reference values; missing old data resolves to polarity-specific reference; Ron=RonNom*(L/Lref)*(Wref/W), Cgate=CgatePerW*W*(L/Lref), Cdiff=CdiffPerW*W; Rust is authoritative.
@dec id=M3-TIMING-001 c=H :: net load sums connected MOS gate and drain/source diffusion capacitance; resolved high/low uses corresponding active path R; delay_ns=0.69*Rohm*Cff*1e-6; waveform output transitions retain fractional ns while static truth tables remain operating-point results.
@dec id=M3-DRIVE-001 c=H :: static solver maps HIGH=technology VDD,LOW=0; NMOS selected HIGH conducts only VDD>Vtn, PMOS selected LOW conducts only VDD>|Vtp|; unknown gates remain unknown; active weighted graph reports shortest high/low drive path resistance by summing device Ron.
@dec id=M3-PHYS-001 c=H :: M3.6 physical synthesis uses Rust layout IR independent of schematic coordinates; normalize topology,share diffusion,place rows,route layers,check rules+connectivity,then derive identical 2D/GDS and 3D geometry.
@dec id=M3-PHYS-IR-001 c=H :: physical IR v1 contains technology/source identity,sorted MOS devices with W/L+gate/drain/source net IDs,canonical nets with roles+terminals,and sorted external pins; schematic positions,rotations,wire routes absent; Tauri generate_physical_ir is read-only.
@dec id=M3-PHYS-PREVIEW-001 c=H :: Rust compact_preview emits generic base/process-bounded metal+via layer strings with fixed rows/rails+connectivity anchors; M1 carries power/device drops,signals cycle across M2..configured max,and transitions receive landing metal+via stacks; PHVIEW builds matching layer styles/toggles dynamically; router remains provisional.
@dec id=M3-PHYS-FOLD-001 c=H :: compact_preview scores candidate column counts by aspect-ratio error,folds each polarity into multiple banks,expands rails/well/substrate to footprint,and staggers row drops; 128-MOS regression requires aspect<1.5; topology/hierarchy-aware macro floorplanning remains next.
@dec id=M3-NAV-SCALE-001 c=H :: schematic zoom width=2..4096,F/Home fits placed components+wire geometry,Shift-arrows accelerate pan; 3D orthographic controls zoom=.00001..200 and Top view/Fit restores IR bounds.
@dec id=SCHEMATIC-OPEN-FIT-001 c=H :: app increments fitRevision only on initial create,New,and Open; schematic fits component+free-wire geometry on revision/mount; ordinary edit/history/simulation workspace replacements preserve camera.
@dec id=WAVE-SCROLL-001 c=H :: waveform root/canvas are height-constrained+overflow-hidden; settings owns vertical scroll; lane grid uses flex-height zero base,explicit vertical scrollbar+independent horizontal time scroll,sticky labels remain synchronized.
@dec id=WAVE-CURSOR-001 c=H :: pointer click/drag maps SVG X to fractional ns; vertical cursor spans all lanes; header reports cursor time; sticky label shows five-state cursor value; horizontal scroll maps left plot boundary to edgeTime; each label owns sticky 1/0/X badge positioned at HIGH/LOW/mid Y for value where trace meets block.
@dec id=M11-SIGNAL-VIZ-001 c=H :: after physical connectivity equivalence,3D shapes retain stable simulation-net identity and can toggle process colors vs HIGH/LOW/FLOATING/CONTENDED/UNKNOWN state; active MOS channels+rail paths highlight; net isolation+waveform cursor update materials without layout regeneration.
@dec id=M4-PHYS-DRC-001 c=H :: versioned process YAML owns units+grid,width,spacing,via/contact size+pitch+enclosure,poly/diffusion,well,metal-area/notch/EOL,tap/rail/pin-access rules; headless Rust checks canonical physical shapes; diagnostics carry stable rule ID,severity,shape IDs,measured/required/layer; 3D overlays select+frame violations; step toward signoff-ready generation,foundry correlation remains M9.
@dec id=M4-MULTIPASS-001 c=H :: run 2-3 deterministic physical candidates:topology/diffusion-sharing,minimum-legal-area folded,and when warranted pin/congestion-balanced; reject DRC/connectivity failures; score area+unused channel,overflow/pin access,wirelength,vias,diffusion utilization; aspect penalty only outside practical bounds and squareness=tiebreaker; expose score rationale in 3D.
@dec id=M4-WAVE-BUS-001 c=H :: persisted user groups define name+ordered MSB..LSB scalar members+binary/hex radix+collapsed state; sticky label and stable intervals show aggregate cursor/time value; value changes draw crossed-X bus boundaries; simultaneous member events resolve before aggregation; UNKNOWN/CONTENDED/unresolved FLOATING propagate X digits; expand restores scalar lanes without resimulation.
@dec id=M5-TIMING-PHYS-001 c=H :: add physical wire/layer/via capacitance,fanout,switching+critical-path costs to M4 candidates; score order=legal/connectivity,configured timing target,area/congestion/wire/vias,then aspect; critical path may justify larger/less-square winner while noncritical repeats choose smallest well-routed result.
@dec id=M3-PHYS-NAV-001 c=H :: 3D mode hides top floating view/simulation controls; PHVIEW left sidebar owns view navigation,top-fit reset,IR summary,layer toggles,interaction help.
@dec id=M3-HIER-001 c=H :: Project stores shared BlockDefinition source+promoted input/output/power/ground pins; definitions may contain block instances to arbitrary acyclic depth; recursive deterministic UUID expansion flattens at simulation/truth/waveform/DRC/physical boundaries; each promoted boundary becomes a junction; graph validation rejects missing deps+direct/indirect cycles; export/save writes all adjacent chippyblocks dependencies; open validates merged graph; descend/edit canvas deferred M4.
@constraint id=M3-NONGOALS-001 c=H :: no SPICE compatibility,continuous nonlinear MOS equations,extracted interconnect parasitics,or signoff claims in M3.
