@node id=APP-NODE c=H lvl=L2 fid=lossy imp=H vol=H cost=H files=APP,SCH,VIEW3,CSS,TYPES,BRIDGE deps=MODEL-NODE,DRC-NODE,SIM-NODE usedby=none :: desktop editor shell, schematic interaction, 3D inferred layout, DRC/simulation/truth-table UX.
